      "writtenOn": "2026-11-09T12:40:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for the suggestion. I put the load-time drop into change [96941] to show the direction. It keeps those configurations out of `configurations` when they are loaded.\n\nFor this change, the plan is to add a small validator that `parseProbeCommand` calls to reject a misplaced `NOT` and log the reason. If that direction works, I would send a separate change that checks `AND`/`OR` placement in the same validator.\nDoes that fit what you had in mind?\n\n[96941]: https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/entity-manager/+/96941",
      "parentUuid": "b5282fb6_2b4dd267",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 138,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 140,
        "endChar": 27
      },
      "revId": "ea835262e9a023cbdeb9b8373a3a1f0cc375245f",
